{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/110740","id":2846679047,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc6prOAH","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/110740","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/110740.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/110740.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110740","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/110740/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/110740/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110740/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/8595875390d800acf4dd2887c566f82da35bea00","number":110740,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"No range check in orthogonal camera","user":{"login":"StamLord","id":42681607,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQyNjgxNjA3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/42681607?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/StamLord","html_url":"https://github.com/StamLord","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StamLord/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StamLord/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StamLord/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StamLord/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StamLord/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StamLord/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StamLord/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StamLord/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StamLord/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"This is an attempt to fix #110653\r\n\r\nThis fix assumes it makes sense to ignore range checks for orthogonal cameras as they are meant to display objects regardless of distance.\r\n\r\n- Added `is_orthogonal` to both `CullData` and `VisibilityCullData`\r\n- Skipped `range_check` in `_scene_cull` and in `_visibility_cull` when the camera is orthogonal\r\n\r\n**Important:** \r\n- The issue seems fixed in the editor's orthogonal views with only `_scene_cull` patched. \r\n- I don't fully understand the differences between `_scene_cull` and `_visibility_cull` so I chose to apply the changes symmetricaIly.\r\n- In `_visibility_cull` I chose to clear all flags but I might be missing some use cases.\r\n\r\n<!--\r\nPlease target the `master` branch in priority.\r\n\r\nRelevant fixes are cherry-picked for stable branches as needed by maintainers.\r\n\r\nTo speed up the contribution process and avoid CI errors, please set up pre-commit hooks locally:\r\nhttps://contributing.godotengine.org/en/latest/engine/guidelines/code_style.html\r\n-->\r\n","labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","description":"","color":"ff6055","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098111,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgxMTE=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:rendering","name":"topic:rendering","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":2666708289,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNjY2NzA4Mjg5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:3d","name":"topic:3d","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":8237783,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AfbLX","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengi